        "text": "After capturing a shadowless horse, Fang Yuan uses Perceivable Dao on it and finds dark path and light path dao marks along with many enslavement path dao marks. Before selling two desolate beast corpses taken from Crazed Demon Cave, a monkey king and a tree python, he uses the Gu on them and finds they carry all sorts of dao marks at once, unlike a desolate beast’s usual single path.",
